[
  {
    "id": "16EeKUo1TFlipf950nPiry7mpCxdq6Cp--fill-1",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "下列何者正確？答：＿＿。"
      },
      {
        "type": "options",
        "items": [
          "$\\sqrt3+\\sqrt3=\\sqrt6$",
          "$\\sqrt6\\div3=\\sqrt2$",
          "$\\sqrt2\\times\\sqrt8=4$",
          "$\\sqrt7-\\sqrt2=\\sqrt5$"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "bd8fca5dc5ad580cb8c87a2b79f7d35fb5a50c705aba2208e7c63ecf447d6746"
  },
  {
    "id": "16EeKUo1TFlipf950nPiry7mpCxdq6Cp--fill-2",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "下列哪一個數與 $\\sqrt6$ 是同類方根？答：＿＿。"
      },
      {
        "type": "options",
        "items": [
          "$\\sqrt{18}$",
          "$\\dfrac2{\\sqrt3}$",
          "$\\sqrt{\\dfrac23}$",
          "$\\sqrt{36}$"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "bd8fca5dc5ad580cb8c87a2b79f7d35fb5a50c705aba2208e7c63ecf447d6746"
  },
  {
    "id": "16EeKUo1TFlipf950nPiry7mpCxdq6Cp--fill-3",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "下列多項式中，哪些是 $4x^2(x-2)$ 與 $x(x-2)^2$ 的公因式？答：＿＿。"
      },
      {
        "type": "options",
        "items": [
          "$2x$",
          "$x-2$",
          "$(x-2)^2$",
          "$x(x-2)$"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "bd8fca5dc5ad580cb8c87a2b79f7d35fb5a50c705aba2208e7c63ecf447d6746"
  },
  {
    "id": "16EeKUo1TFlipf950nPiry7mpCxdq6Cp--fill-4",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "所有根式皆須化為最簡根式：$2\\sqrt3\\times(-\\sqrt7)=$ ＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "bd8fca5dc5ad580cb8c87a2b79f7d35fb5a50c705aba2208e7c63ecf447d6746"
  },
  {
    "id": "16EeKUo1TFlipf950nPiry7mpCxdq6Cp--fill-5",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "所有根式皆須化為最簡根式：$5\\sqrt5-2\\sqrt5=$ ＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "bd8fca5dc5ad580cb8c87a2b79f7d35fb5a50c705aba2208e7c63ecf447d6746"
  },
  {
    "id": "16EeKUo1TFlipf950nPiry7mpCxdq6Cp--fill-6",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "如圖，求直角三角形的邊長 $x=$ ＿＿。"
      },
      {
        "type": "svg",
        "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 210\"><g font-family=\"serif\" font-size=\"19\"><path d=\"M40 160H270V40ZM260 160V150H270\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /><g font-family=\"serif\" font-size=\"20\"><text x=\"157\" y=\"99\">17</text><text x=\"277\" y=\"115\">8</text><text x=\"151\" y=\"184\">x</text></g></g></svg>",
