    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "bd8fca5dc5ad580cb8c87a2b79f7d35fb5a50c705aba2208e7c63ecf447d6746"
  },
  {
    "id": "16EeKUo1TFlipf950nPiry7mpCxdq6Cp--fill-7",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "所有根式皆須化為最簡根式：$(\\sqrt{18}+\\sqrt{27})(\\sqrt3-\\sqrt2)=$ ＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "bd8fca5dc5ad580cb8c87a2b79f7d35fb5a50c705aba2208e7c63ecf447d6746"
  },
  {
    "id": "16EeKUo1TFlipf950nPiry7mpCxdq6Cp--fill-8-1",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "因式分解：$3x^2+8x=$ ＿＿。"
