    "id": "16EeKUo1TFlipf950nPiry7mpCxdq6Cp--fill-8-2",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "因式分解：$(2x+1)(x-1)-(x-1)(x+2)=$ ＿＿。"
