  },
  {
    "id": "16EeKUo1TFlipf950nPiry7mpCxdq6Cp--fill-8-6",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "因式分解：$x^2-4y^2-22x+121=$ ＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "bd8fca5dc5ad580cb8c87a2b79f7d35fb5a50c705aba2208e7c63ecf447d6746"
  },
  {
    "id": "16EeKUo1TFlipf950nPiry7mpCxdq6Cp--fill-9",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "若 $\\sqrt{72}-\\sqrt{32}=\\sqrt k$，則 $k=$ ＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "bd8fca5dc5ad580cb8c87a2b79f7d35fb5a50c705aba2208e7c63ecf447d6746"
  },
  {
    "id": "16EeKUo1TFlipf950nPiry7mpCxdq6Cp--fill-10",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "若 $6$、$8$、$a$ 為直角三角形的三邊長，則 $a=$ ＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "bd8fca5dc5ad580cb8c87a2b79f7d35fb5a50c705aba2208e7c63ecf447d6746"
  },
  {
    "id": "16EeKUo1TFlipf950nPiry7mpCxdq6Cp--fill-11",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "如圖，$\\angle ACB=90^\\circ$，$\\overline{AB}$、$\\overline{BC}$、$\\overline{AC}$ 分別是正方形甲、乙、丙的邊長。若乙、丙的面積分別為 $51$、$34$，則甲的面積為＿＿。"
      },
      {
        "type": "svg",
        "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 240 280\"><g font-family=\"serif\" font-size=\"19\"><path d=\"M160 100L60 155L5 55L105 0ZM60 155H160V255H60ZM160 100H215V155H160\" fill=\"#eee\" stroke=\"#111\"/><path d=\"M160 100V155H60ZM150 155V145H160\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /><g font-family=\"serif\" font-size=\"20\"><text x=\"160\" y=\"94\">A</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"172\">B</text><text x=\"165\" y=\"176\">C</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"78\">甲</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"213\">乙</text><text x=\"175\" y=\"137\">丙</text></g></g></svg>",
        "maxHeight": 100
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "bd8fca5dc5ad580cb8c87a2b79f7d35fb5a50c705aba2208e7c63ecf447d6746"
  },
  {
    "id": "16EeKUo1TFlipf950nPiry7mpCxdq6Cp--fill-12",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "若 $x-1$ 與 $x-3$ 為 $-2x^2-ax+b$ 的因式，則 $a+b=$ ＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "bd8fca5dc5ad580cb8c87a2b79f7d35fb5a50c705aba2208e7c63ecf447d6746"
  },
  {
    "id": "16EeKUo1TFlipf950nPiry7mpCxdq6Cp--fill-13",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "坐標平面上有 $C(-4,1)$、$D(2,10)$ 兩點，求 $\\overline{CD}=$ ＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "bd8fca5dc5ad580cb8c87a2b79f7d35fb5a50c705aba2208e7c63ecf447d6746"
  },
  {
    "id": "16EeKUo1TFlipf950nPiry7mpCxdq6Cp--fill-14",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "已知 $4x^2+ax+9$ 為完全平方式，則 $a=$ ＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "bd8fca5dc5ad580cb8c87a2b79f7d35fb5a50c705aba2208e7c63ecf447d6746"
  },
  {
    "id": "16EeKUo1TFlipf950nPiry7mpCxdq6Cp--fill-15",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "如圖，已知四邊形 $ABCD$ 是一個矩形，$\\overline{BE}\\perp\\overline{CE}$，$\\overline{BE}=15$，$\\overline{CE}=20$，則矩形 $ABCD$ 周長為＿＿。"
      },
      {
        "type": "svg",
        "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 210\"><g font-family=\"serif\" font-size=\"19\"><path d=\"M40 50H280V170H40ZM40 170L126.4 50L280 170\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /><path d=\"M120.4 58L128.4 64L134.4 56\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /><g font-family=\"serif\" font-size=\"20\"><text x=\"20\" y=\"49\">A</text><text x=\"22\" y=\"190\">B</text><text x=\"282\" y=\"190\">C</text><text x=\"284\" y=\"49\">D</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"38\">E</text></g></g></svg>",
        "maxHeight": 100
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "bd8fca5dc5ad580cb8c87a2b79f7d35fb5a50c705aba2208e7c63ecf447d6746"
  },
  {
    "id": "16EeKUo1TFlipf950nPiry7mpCxdq6Cp--fill-16",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "如圖，邊長為 $6$ 和 $8$ 的兩個正方形併排在一起，兩正方形中心點的連線距離為＿＿。"
      },
      {
        "type": "svg",
        "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 295 210\"><g font-family=\"serif\" font-size=\"19\"><path d=\"M45 95H135V185H45ZM135 65H255V185H135Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /></g></svg>",
