  },
  {
    "id": "16EeKUo1TFlipf950nPiry7mpCxdq6Cp--written-2",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "有一直角三角形周長為 $20$，面積為 $10$，請問此直角三角形斜邊為何？"
      }
    ],
    "verified": true,
    "sourceSha256": "bd8fca5dc5ad580cb8c87a2b79f7d35fb5a50c705aba2208e7c63ecf447d6746"
  },
  {
    "id": "16EeKUo1TFlipf950nPiry7mpCxdq6Cp--written-3",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "已知 $x$、$y$ 為自然數，若 $x^2-4y^2=17$，則 $x+y=$ ？"
      }
